   562 				; Step $09 - Menu banner palette-demo overlay: assembly-embed the RGB ramps
   563 				; for hardware palettes 1-3 directly into MENU_BANNER_PAL_VRAM (bank $34),
   564 				; at the same $0300/$0600/$0900 slot offsets Apply_Menu_Banner_Palette
