   668 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   669 				; Image_Open - OPEN FileNamePtr for read on the first free IOCB (the same
   670 				; sequence LoadData uses, but the file stays open across several block reads).
   671 				;  Out: C=0 and Load_IOCB = IOCB offset, or C=1 (no IOCB / OPEN failed - the
   672 				;       IOCB is closed again so it doesn't leak).
   673 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
