   948 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   949 				; Set_Menu_Demo_Attrs - poke palette_id<<4 into the expanded attribute map's
   950 				; (MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM) cell covering each of the demo overlay's 8 squares,
   951 				; for all MENU_DEMO_SQUARE rows each square spans.  Plain CPU loop (no
   952 				; blitter - a small, one-time boot fixup, overriding whatever D:MENU.MAP
   953 				; supplied for just these cells).  MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM is exactly bank-
   954 				; aligned, so a running byte offset from its start splits cleanly into a
   955 				; bank number (offset's upper nibbles) and a window address (offset's low
   956 				; 12 bits) - recomputed every byte, since the covered rows straddle the
   957 				; $35xxx/$36xxx bank boundary partway through (row 25 already crosses it).
   958 				; Called once from start:, after Load_Menu_Banner_Raw.
   959 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
