  1245 37F0			Handle_Keys
  1246 				; Dispatch on the current UI mode - the selector, slideshow, drive picker and
  1247 				; info viewer each have their own key set (ui.asm); mode 1 (image view) uses
  1248 				; the set below.
  1249 37F0 AD FC 02			lda CH
