   938 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   939 				; Nfo_Name_LoadManifest - open "D[n]:PATH IMAGES.LST", and for every record
   940 				; (8-byte key + description + $9B) store it into the matching *.V1K
   941 				; row's slot.  Called from Rescan_Images right after Nfo_Name_ClearCache.
   942 				; A missing / unreadable file just leaves every slot $00 (blank status line).
   943 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
